# SurfBud — Design System (Quick Reference)

## Brand
Primary: Ocean Teal `#0891B2` · Background: Ice White `#F0F9FF` · Cards: `#FFFFFF` · Light theme only.

## Core Color Tokens
```
--color-primary:        #0891B2   buttons, links, active nav
--color-primary-700:    #0E7490   hover
--color-bg-page:        #F0F9FF   page background (NOT pure white)
--color-bg-card:        #FFFFFF   cards
--color-text-heading:   #0F172A   metric numbers, titles
--color-text-body:      #334155   body text
--color-text-muted:     #94A3B8   labels, timestamps
--color-success:        #16A34A   positive delta, streak active
--color-danger:         #DC2626   negative delta, errors
--color-warning:        #D97706   caution states
--color-mode-dev:       #7C3AED   --color-mode-chill: #E11D48
--color-mode-deepwork:  #0891B2   --color-mode-study: #059669
```
Never hardcode hex values. Always use CSS tokens or Tailwind mapped classes.

## Typography Rules
```
Display (titles, card headings)  → font-display (Plus Jakarta Sans) 600/700
UI (all interface text)          → font-sans (Inter) 400/500/600/700
Numbers (ALL metrics)            → font-sans + tabular-nums + lining-nums — ALWAYS
Filenames/paths                  → font-mono (JetBrains Mono) 400
```
`tabular-nums` on every number. `min-width: 4ch` on every animated metric container.

## Glass Effects
Applied ONLY to: metric cards · chart containers · AI insight cards.
NEVER on: nav · tooltips · modals · side panel shell · toasts · buttons.
```css
.card-metric-glass  → bg white/80 · blur(20px) · teal border · shadow-glass
.chart-glass        → bg white/65 · blur(12px) · teal border · shadow-glass
/* hover: translateY(-3px) + shadow-glass-hover */
/* fallback: @supports not (backdrop-filter) → solid white card */
```

## Animation Rules
```
✅ Safe (GPU):    transform · opacity · box-shadow · color · background-color
❌ Never animate: width · height · margin · padding · top · left (causes layout shift)

ease-spring → ONLY for streak milestones and mode switches
All other transitions → ease-out at 150–300ms
```

## Shadows — Always Teal-Tinted
```
shadow-sm      resting cards
shadow-md      hovered cards
shadow-glass   glass metric cards and chart containers
shadow-primary primary buttons only
```
Never use Tailwind's default grey shadows.

## Recharts — Always
```
Wrap in .chart-glass · Use shared CHART_COLORS/CHART_AXIS_STYLE/CHART_TOOLTIP_STYLE
ResponsiveContainer always · never fixed pixel width
Line: dot=false, animationDuration=800
Bar: radius={[4,4,0,0]}
Area: fillOpacity={0.12}
```

## Spacing
8px base grid. `gap` between cards always, never `margin`.
